TITLE:: RCSwing
summary:: Swing function of a layer
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCLayer, Classes/RCBeat

DESCRIPTION::
code::value(t):: is the time offset (beats) added to the event that starts at running time strong::t:: of a beat. Default shape: code::amount * sin(pi * (t % mod)) + shift::. A custom code::func:: receives code::(t, swing)::. Non-finite results become 0.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: new
argument:: amount
argument:: mod
argument:: shift
argument:: func

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: value
argument:: t
METHOD:: amount
METHOD:: mod
METHOD:: shift
METHOD:: func
